; --- 37E: the way to the Ashfall Homestead --------------------------------------
; The cottage that stood here until 37E was `bld_cottage.glb` -- a sealed 4.8 m mesh you could not
; enter -- beside a ROOFLESS pen of grey BoxMesh walls holding the stash and two greybox pillars.
; The whole holding moved to its own cell east of the Embermarket, where it is a house you walk into.
;
; ⚠️ WHAT STAYS BEHIND IS A SIGNPOST, AND IT IS NOT DECORATION. The deed post moved with the house,
; so nothing in the square would otherwise tell a player a house exists at all -- and a sink nobody
; can find is a sink nobody spends into. This is 37D's own lesson (it moved the deed OUT of the
; middle of the square and had to leave the player a reason to walk to it) applied one cell further.
;
; BuildingSW keeps bld_cottage_modular: it is a generic town house and always was.

